#: src/ch02-00-guessing-game-tutorial.md
msgid "This code contains a lot of information, so let’s go over it line by line. To obtain user input and then print the result as output, we need to bring the `io` input/output library into scope. The `io` library comes from the standard library, known as `std`:"
