"```console\n"
"$ cargo check\n"
"    Checking hello v0.1.0 (file:///projects/hello)\n"
"error[E0599]: no associated function or constant named `new` found for struct `ThreadPool` in the current scope\n"
"  --> src/main.rs:12:28\n"
"   |\n"
"12 |     let pool = ThreadPool::new(4);\n"
